  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "おびえると　タマネギ１００コぶんの\nさいるいせいぶんを　もつ　なみだを\nながして　もらいなき　させる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "겁을 먹으면 양파 100개와 맞먹는\n최루 성분의 눈물을 흘려서\n상대도 덩달아 울게 만든다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "害怕時流下的淚水中含有\n相當於１００顆洋蔥的催淚成分，\n能讓對手淚流不止。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Quand il a peur, il pleure des larmes contenant\nune substance lacrymogène d’une puissance\néquivalente à celle de cent oignons.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Hat es Angst, vergießt es Tränen, die Reizstoffe\nenthalten, welche andere ebenfalls zum Weinen\nbringen. Sie sind so stark wie 100 Zwiebeln.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cuando se espanta, libera unas lágrimas con un\nfactor lacrimógeno equivalente a 100 cebollas\npara hacer llorar también al rival.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se si spaventa, produce lacrime con un fattore\nlacrimogeno cento volte più potente di quello di\nuna cipolla per far piangere anche i nemici.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "When scared, this Pokémon cries. Its tears pack\nthe chemical punch of 100 onions, and attackers\nwon’t be able to resist weeping.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "怯えると　玉ねぎ１００個分の\n催涙成分を　もつ　涙を\n流して　もらい泣き　させる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "害怕时流下的泪水中含有\n相当于１００颗洋葱的催泪成分，\n能让对手泪流不止。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cuando se espanta, libera unas lágrimas con un\nfactor lacrimógeno equivalente a 100 cebollas\npara hacer llorar también al rival.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ひふの　いろは　ぬれると　かわる。\nカモフラージュ　されたかの　ように\nすがたが　みえなく　なるのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "젖으면 피부색이 변한다.\n위장한 것처럼\n모습이 보이지 않게 된다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "皮膚在濕掉時會變色，\n彷彿像是隱身了一樣，\n誰都看不見牠的身影。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sa peau change de couleur et le rend invisible\nquand elle est mouillée, comme un camouflage.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Wird seine Haut feucht, ändert sich ihre Farbe.\nDies dient ihm zur Tarnung, da man es dann\nnicht mehr sehen kann.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Al mojarse, su piel cambia de color y pasa a ser\ninvisible, como si se hubiese camuflado.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Quando si bagna, la pelle cambia colore e lo\nrende invisibile, come se si fosse mimetizzato.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "When it gets wet, its skin changes color,\nand this Pokémon becomes invisible as if\nit were camouflaged.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "皮膚の　色は　濡れると　変わる。\nカモフラージュ　されたかの　ように\n姿が　見えなく　なるのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "皮肤在湿掉时会变色，\n仿佛像是隐身了一样，\n谁都看不见它的身影。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Al mojarse, su piel cambia de color y pasa a ser\ninvisible, como si se hubiese camuflado.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "くちから　ふきだす　みずのたまできのみを　うちおとして　たべる。ねらいは　ひゃっぱつひゃくちゅうだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "입에서 뿜어내는 물의 탄환으로 나무열매를 떨어뜨려서 먹는다. 조준은 백발백중이다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會利用口中噴出的水彈擊落樹果來吃。彈無虛發，百發百中。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Avec une précision infaillible, il crache des balles d’eau sur des Baies pour les faire tomber et s’en nourrir.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es feuert Wassergeschosse aus seinem Mund, um Beeren herabzuschießen und dann zu fressen. Jeder Schuss ist ein Treffer.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dispara proyectiles de agua por la boca para hacer caer bayas de los árboles y comérselas. Su puntería es infalible.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Spara proiettili d’acqua dalla bocca per far cadere dagli alberi le bacche di cui si nutre. La sua mira è infallibile.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It gets berries to eat by shooting them down with bullets of water it spurts from its mouth. Its aim is perfect.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "口から　吹き出す　水の弾で木の実を　撃ち落として　食べる。狙いは　百発百中だ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "利用从口中喷出的水弹击落树果来吃。能够做到百发百中。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dispara proyectiles de agua por la boca para hacer caer bayas de los árboles y comérselas. Su puntería es infalible.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "けいかいしんが　つよく　どうしてもたたかわないと　いけない　ときはすがたを　けしてから　こうげきする。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "경계심이 강하다. 반드시 싸워야만 할 때는 모습을 감춘 다음 공격한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "警戒心十分強，遇到無論如何都得戰鬥時，會先讓身影消失再發動攻擊。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon est très prudent. Quand il ne peut pas échapper au combat, il se camoufle avant d’attaquer.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es ist extrem vorsichtig. Wenn sich ein Kampf nicht vermeiden lässt, greift es erst an, nachdem es sich getarnt hat.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es tan precavido que, cuando no le queda más remedio que combatir, siempre se camufla antes de atacar.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "È molto cauto. Quando è costretto a lottare, sferra i suoi attacchi solo dopo essersi mimetizzato.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It’s a very cautious Pokémon. When it has no choice but to battle, it hides itself before attacking.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "警戒心が　強く　どうしても戦わないと　いけない　ときは姿を　消してから　攻撃する。",
      "language": {
